window.products.push({"id":937129,"name":"Personalized Teak Cutting Board, Husband Gift, Camping Gift, Camping Decor, Happy Campers, Camping Sign, Camping Gifts, Camping Gear, Dad Gifts, Chris","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tASHAzBhL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Personalized Teak wood Cutting Board with a camping theme is an elegant and unique piece to give a loved one, or yourself! These beautiful cutting boards can also be used as cheese boards or serving trays -- perfect for displaying at your parties and gatherings! The boards are slim and lightweight, with gently rounded edges, perfect for picking up and serving guests.  You will not find a more beautiful cheese or cutting board, perfect for serving appetizers at your party! You can also use this year round by displaying it in your kitchen or dining room, or even on your fireplace mantel! This will be the talk of your party.  Our elegant Teak boards have the following characteristics: Large Board: 16 x 11 x 0.55 inches; weight 2 lbs Large Board: 16 x 11 x 0.55 inches; weight 2 lbs Medium Board: 14 x 9.5 x 0.55 inches Medium Board: 14 x 9.5 x 0.55 inches Small Board: 12 x 8 x 0.55 inches Small Board: 12 x 8 x 0.55 inches 100% Teak Wood (Sustainably sourced) 100% Teak Wood (Sustainably sourced) Food safe Food safe Customized laser engraved design Customized laser engraved design Our exotic and beautiful teak boards are FSC certified, meaning they are sustainably sourced (not from the rain forest). The board is 100% natural Teak wood, completely food safe, free of harsh chemicals. This is sure to become a treasured family heirloom.  PLEASE INCLUDE: The family name you want engraved The family name you want engraved Please hand wash this item and treat it with care -- do not stick it in the dishwasher. Do not soak any wood cutting boards. As with any wood cutting board, consider oiling it occasionally with Mineral oil, to maintain its luster.  Because of the unique nature of wood pieces, each serving board may vary slightly in appearance and color, but each is a work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tASHAzBhL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Sinclair Company","source_asin":"B07H7384Z2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H7384Z2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H7384Z2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
