window.products.push({"id":937192,"name":"50332 Canner Pressure Regulator for Presto Pressure Cooker Canner,fit 5-10-15lb Weight Models 0175001, 0175510, 0178107, 0178410 for 6qt/8qt/12qt/16qt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51euDOWRcYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3-Piece Pressure Regulator】It consists of the pressure regulator body and two 5-pound weight rings. Completely assembled, it will maintain 15-pounds of pressure.3-Piece Pressure Regulator adopts advanced three-layer electroplating process and high-strength environment-friendly alloy materials, so that it has high wear resistance, corrosion resistance, temperature resistance and long service life. 【Warm Tips For Use】After the 10-minute venting period, place the 3-Piece Pressure Regulator on the vent pipe. Once the pressure regulator starts to rock gently, the processing time gegins. Adjust heat to maintain a slow, steady rocking motion during the process. 【Fit Model】50332 pressure cooker parts compatible with Presto pressure canners models 0171001, 0171002, 0171003, 0174001, 0174510,0175001, 0175510, 0177001, 0178107, 0178209, 0178410, 02/CAA12H, 02/CAA16H, 02/CAA20H etc. Replacement for pressures lower than 15psi, such as 09978/9913 etc. Works on pressure canners 6qt/8qt/12qt/16qt/18qt/20qt/21qt/22qt/23qt etc. Note: 50332 isn't universal regulator, please check the following chart to ensure the compatibility. 【More Convenient than Traditional Function】With the adjustable pressure canner weight, it's a great help to control the amount of pressure in the canner. And it’s convenient to mantain the correct pressure, so you no longer need to sit in front of the stove, watching the gauge like a hawk, more convenient & energy efficient. 【Worry-free Warranty 】Pokin manufactures advanced cookingware accessories. If you are not satisfied with anything, we guarantee a full refund or replacement.If you are not satisfied with our products or you buy the wrong model, you can contact us, we will give you a free refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51euDOWRcYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pokin","source_asin":"B0BR3HVFV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR3HVFV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR3HVFV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
