window.products.push({"id":937222,"name":"Creative Converting Colorado Buffaloes Plastic Banquet Table Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uxzONG8RL._AC_.jpg","description":"Get up. It's game day. Up and coming collegiate teams battle it out for their spot in the bowl games. Back your favorite divisions and teams with championship-worthy party decor. Tablecloth is constructed from light-medium weight plastic, measures 54-Inch wide x 108-Inch long and is designed to fit standard rectangle shaped banquet tables up to 8 feet in length. Team tablecloth has University of Colorado logo print and mascot all over the top and edges. Creatively convert your gatherings into the biggest events of the year. Support the Buffaloes with our NCAA football college collection featuring black and gold paper plates, napkins and cups with matching streamers and table coverings. Just the ticket for hosting a CU tailgating or house party that generates just as much excitement as the game itself. With over 80 years of combined experience in the paper and party goods industry, Creative Converting has successfully transformed game-watching get together, college graduations and sports fan's birthdays in every state into unforgettable memories and commemorations with a complete offering of premium strength disposable paper tableware, coordinating decor and fun accessory items. Creative Converting can more than accommodate all your party and event needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uxzONG8RL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B0082AKJE2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0082AKJE2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0082AKJE2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":937223,"name":"DecorShore Frontiers Collection - Rustic Farmhouse Décor Accents - Castle Dome, 30\" x 22\" Oval Decorative Wall Mirror, Metal Framed Vanity Mirror - Ac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Euyc2+BqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Farmhouse Chic Mirror - Home Décor Accents inspired by the idyllic country farm homes that beckon the return to days filled with simple joys and family togetherness…. The Frontiers Collection 30\" x 22\" elliptical decorative wall mirror is handmade and consists of an antique floral patterned frame. Rustic pressed metal sheet with authentic, hand-finished seams frames an antique, oval shaped mirror. The mirror size and transitional style make for the perfect decorative mirror in powder rooms,vanities, or entryways. Looking for decor accents for your lodge, homestead, farmhouse, cottage, shaker and rustic decorating themes? Our unique wall mirror features pressed sheet metal over a compressed wood substrate in beautiful antique silver. Combined with other farmhouse accents, hardwood furnishings and industrial fixtures, each metal wall mirror is the perfect mix of antique looks and contemporary country charm. Our unique wall decor is created for the modern decorating enthusiast, and inspired by rolling hills and countrysides leading to historic homesteads & farmhouses showcasing functional furnishings. The decorating styles of settlers and ranchers during the early rise of U.S.A. industry produces the type of Americana synonymous with apple pie and evenings on the porch. Artistic re-creations of these pieces are presented in the DecorShore Frontiers Collection; unique Decorative Wall Mirrors and Home decor accents. See all 4 styles from DecorShore Frontier Collection!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Euyc2+BqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DecorShore","source_asin":"B06W9G8WKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06W9G8WKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06W9G8WKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
