window.products.push({"id":937362,"name":"fyumee All Natural Luxury Soy Jar Candle for Home Scented, Highly Rose Scented Aromatherapy Tumbler Candle with Handmade Glass Jar for Relaxation & St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DxUldUcYS._AC_SL1180_.jpg","description":"HAND-DECORATED, HAND-POURED, LOVE MADE: Every single Fyumee luxury vegan soy candle is fully handmade and produced by skilled artisans. We take great pride in hand-painting every color and hand-printing every design on the glass. Fyumee jar candles are not only beautiful and decorative, they are designed to be a keepsake after the candle is gone, repurpose the beautiful glass jar using your imagination. SCENT NOTES: The luxurious pink glass jar candle infused with pink rose essential oils. Base notes of vanilla and coconut are followed by a strong rose scent as if passing through a garden full of budding pink roses. Fyumee's heavenly scented aromatherapy soy candles comply with the IFRA standards and represent a different story with different scent notes. Highly scented Fyumee single-wick candle offers a long-lasting burn time of 50 hours. RENEWABLE & BIODEGRADABLE: Our all-natural aromatherapy candles are made of pure soy wax, cotton wick, and a unique blend of essential and perfume-grade fragrance oils. All the ingredients used are vegan and give a non-toxic, soot-free, and clean burn. Soy wax is a biodegradable and renewable source, unlike paraffin. Fyumee candles contain zero paraffin. Aromatherapy soy candles calm the nerves, relieve anxiety, and can be used for insomnia, meditation, relaxation, sleep, and removing odors. DAZZLE AND SPOIL YOUR LOVED ONES: “Be yourself today, you look beautiful like that.”: A thoughtful, motivational message for you and your loved ones! The inspiring unique designs and the elegant gift box make our luxury candles the perfect gift for any holiday or special events, such as Christmas, birthday, holiday, anniversary, Valentine’s Day, Mother’s Day, and housewarming gift, and say thank you to women and men. CANDLE CARE: Soy wax has a memory so each time you light the candle allow the melted wax pool to reach the edge of the container to avoid tunneling. And always trim the wick to ¼ inch before each use. If you are not satisfied with your purchase, we invite you to take advantage of our full money-back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DxUldUcYS._AC_SL1180_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FYUMEE","source_asin":"B0977CWJWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0977CWJWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0977CWJWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":937363,"name":"New 8x10 Photo: Famed German Composer of Music Ludwig van Beethoven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lONI8CDoL._AC_.jpg","description":"New borderless print measures 8\" x 10\" (approximate). Our prints are custom made-to-order using a gloss finish on heavy-weight photographic paper. Print is also coated for water-resistance and acid free to prevent yellowing. Includes a protective sleeve to keep your photo looking beautiful for years to come. A Note on Image Quality: The quality of historic images are subject to the wearing of time, the capabilities of the original photographer, and limitations of period technology. History affords us no re-takes; we must content ourselves with what has been left to us. Please note that we do not attempt to fix, enhance or disturb the original image in any way, as we feel these eccentricities add to its historic charm. Thank you for taking this into consideration before making your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lONI8CDoL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victoria","source_asin":"B00D4ZSKXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D4ZSKXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D4ZSKXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
