window.products.push({"id":937422,"name":"Set of 10 Blue Starfish Novelty String Lights - 9ft White Wire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h1cBpzwDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some light to your life with these blue starfish string lights. Their easy glow is sure to bring a nautical ambiance to your outdoor decorations or themed party. These ethereal lights can also be used at a wedding, in a bedroom, or to light your railings. Product Features:. Color: clear bulbs / white wire. Starfish shaped light covers. Number of bulbs on string: 10. Bulb size: mini. Bulb type: incandescent. Spacing between each bulb: 12\". Lighted length: 9'. Total length: 11.5'. 24\" lead cord. 5\" tail cord Additional Product Features:. UL listed for indoor or outdoor use. If one bulb burns out, the rest will stay lit. Comes with replacement bulb and spare fuse. Contains end-to-end connectors which allows you to connect multiple sets together (not to exceed 210 watts). Wire gauge: 22. 120 volts, 60 hertz, .08 amps, 9.6 watts Light cover dimensions: 3.25\"H x 3.25\"W x 1\"D. Material(s): plastic/glass bulbs/wire","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h1cBpzwDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B07LBBFM2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LBBFM2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LBBFM2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":937423,"name":"Lush Decor Blush-and-Gray (84\" x 38\") Delsey Floral Blackout Window Curtain Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RYxo5f-SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of luxury to your home with our Delsey Floral Absolute Blackout Window Curtain Panel Pair. These stylish new curtains add a delightful pattern to your master bedroom, kids' room, nursery, living room, or office. They feature a floral pattern printed on polyester fabric. The classic pattern is eye-catching but will not take over the look of the room. The curtain panels feature blush-pink flowers on a gray background for a sophisticated yet bold design. To care for these curtains, we recommend washing by hand or in the washing machine in cold water with similar colors. Hang dry to maintain the look and feel of these luxurious curtains. Use only non-chlorine bleach as needed. The polyester fabric blocks the light, reducing glare on your TV or computer, making it easier for you to sleep, and giving you the privacy you want. Our blackout panels can also help with heat and energy saving. Each curtain measures 84\" H x 38\" W, so they are wide and tall enough for most windows. Your purchase comes with a pair of curtains. Our design includes metal grommets along the top of the curtains, so you can hang the panels directly on your curtain rod. The fun color scheme coordinates with other colors in your home and isn't overwhelming. The color and design can coordinate with any interior design style from modern to rustic. At Lush Decor, we offer a range of home products that are luxurious yet affordable. All of our products are made by a team of in-house designers who aim to create items that are functional, fashionable, and unique. Shop our line of home accessories, ranging from curtains to bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RYxo5f-SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B07N4PJ51R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N4PJ51R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N4PJ51R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
