window.products.push({"id":937453,"name":"New Classic FURNITURE Celeste Faux Marble Lift Top Coffee Side Table Set, Black with White/Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":415.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BY6PBqO7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New Classic Furniture’s Celeste Occasional Table Sets will complete your elegant living room look in just minutes. Each set includes an easy to assemble coffee table and two end tables. Coffee and End Table set features heat and water-resistant faux marble tops in classic white and gray pattern. The Side Tables are perfectly sized at 22 x22 x 22.5H to accommodate lamps and decorative accessories. The Cocktail Table has a convenient lift top, perfect for positioning devices, entertaining or having a meal in your living room. Designed for small spaces, the 48”W x 24”D coffee table works well in a formal living room or family room. Look for other pieces in the Celeste Collection, including Dining Sets, Counter Dining Sets, Writing Desks and Dining Chairs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BY6PBqO7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Classic Furniture","source_asin":"B08YS22V5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YS22V5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YS22V5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":937454,"name":"LINSY HOME Sectional Sofa Couch, 3 Seat Small Couch with 2 USB Ports and Storage Pockets, Easy to Clean, Modern Small Sofa for Small Spaces, Living Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91N-UEa756L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Without Ottoman】Please note that this ASIN don’t include ottoman. It is just a 3 seat sectional sofa 【Comfort with Ergonomic Design】The ergonomic design has been adopted by this couch, 103°ideal angle, 3-stage support design for waist, back and head, 19'' seat depth and the cushions formulated with 28d high density foam ensure lasting comfort and maximum relaxation 【2 Removable Headrests】 Unlike other sectional sofas with low and thin back cushions, Linsy Home sofa provide two additional removable headrests(yes, it is removable, which means you can take off it within 2s when no need it) to better support neck and head 【Sleepable Armrest Pillows】 We do consider that most of people like lying down on the sofa, so we provide two soft and removable armrest cushions, perfect for you to lie down and take a nap. You will love the time spent on your comfy small sectional couch with it 【Strict Material Selection for Durability】 Each parts of our sofa has been tested repeatedly from the P2 grade wooden frame to the thick hardware. It will stand the test of several decades in terms of durability. And the 100% polyester farbic has passed the CA65 certification, which is environmentally friendly and safe. Don't worry about an allergy attack 【Removable and Washable Cushion Covers】 The seat and back cushion covers are removable for washing with zippers on the back. It Is truly easy to clean 【About the Package】 The maximum capacity of couch is 660lbs. The sofa set comes with 2 boxes, may be delivered at different times. If there are any questions about the 2nd tracking number or the product, please feel free to contact us, we will respond to you in 24 hours and try our best to solve any problem so as to achieve your 100% satisfaction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91N-UEa756L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINSY HOME","source_asin":"B0BTBGJS3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTBGJS3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTBGJS3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":937455,"name":"ARITONE Beer Belt Buckle Bottle Holder You Can Easily Carry Drinks With You，Hands Free Beverage Can Portable Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l0LqqGl3S._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy beer anytime and anywhere with this Beer Belt Buckle Bottle Holder! It can also hold other drinks that can fit in a 70 mm-diameter! Beer is one of the most staple drinks when it comes to parties. But if it really is a fun party, there’s no way you’d be sitting idly on a chair until it is over. You can expect yourself to move around much and it is such a hassle to keep holding a beer in your hand. This is especially true if you don’t plan to consume it right away or have something do while you drink such as cooking. As long as you have this beer belt buckle, you can carry your drink with you conveniently. The main purpose of this item is that it holds the bottle or can in place without the need for you to use your hands. It is basically a belt buckle that you will have to slip through your belt and flip open. Please note that the set only comes with the belt buckle itself and not the belt strap. With that, you don’t have to worry because you can just use any belt you already have at home. The good thing is that you can simply flip the buckle to open and close it. This way, you can place the beer on it any time or wear it as a fashion accessory when you don’t need to drink. The buckle is made of durable and strong high-quality zinc alloy metal. It can effectively support the weight of the drink because it can maintain its shape at 90 degrees. In addition, its appearance design is also very similar to an ordinary belt buckle. There are many colors for you to choose to suit your preferences. Material: Zinc Alloy Size: 10.2cm x 8cm Weight: 243 grams","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l0LqqGl3S._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARITONE","source_asin":"B09ZYFNTRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZYFNTRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZYFNTRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":937456,"name":"SEAAN Electric Hot Pot Grill Removable Shabu-shabu Pot Grill Detachable Barbecue Grill with Large Capacity Baking Tray Non-Stick BBQ Pan Adjustable Te","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vJO49sWlL._AC_.jpg","description":"2 in 1 Dual Function - SEAAN Portable Electric Hotpot & Grill gives you the enjoyment of both hotpot and BBQ, and hotpot with Internal divider can provide you two different tastes at the same time. This Indoor Electric Grill comes with multiple temperature control to separate heater levels for the indoor grill and electric pot. Independent Temperature Control - SEAAN electric shabu shabu hot pot comes with 2 plugs, simple operation,t he temperature of the hot pot and the grill pan is controlled separately by turning knobs. SEAAN Electric Hot Pot Grill is suitable for 8 people, there is no worries about the capacity when having parties with friends and family. Cook together, eat together, and laugh together. Powerful Power 2200W - Grill pan power:1000W, Hot pot power:1200W. Preheating time: 3minutes, quick cooking, enjoy your meal without a long wait. An independent buit-in Aluminium alloy heating tube is able to conduct vertically three-dimensional heat, more uniform, long-lasting and stable heat efficiency and smoke-free. Thickened die-cast aluminium baking tray, safe food grade, high density, high temperature resistance, not easy to burn, better heat storage effect. Temperature Adjustable - There are 5 ranges temperature to be adjusted, you can adjust it according to the varies foods. It will automatically adjust when the temperature is too high or the gear position is wrong. SEAAN Indoor Electric Grill suitable for steaks, vegetables, shellfish, pasta, etc. Removable & Versatile - SEAAN hotpot is removable. Perfect as an indoor smokeless (start at low heat!) grill with a dual hotpot to accompany it! Bone, Herbal, Tomato, Chicken, Kimchi, whatever soup you decide. Power your new indoor grill smokeless pot to cook all types of Cuisines! Make Chinese soup, Japanese BBQ, KBBQ, the options are unlimited!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vJO49sWlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEAAN","source_asin":"B089KG5TGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089KG5TGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089KG5TGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
