window.products.push({"id":937629,"name":"J. HANLON 56771 Laundry and Linen 3 Shelf Rack in White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QOEfj3otL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The J. HANLON Laundry and Linen 3 Shelf Rack is a versatile shelving system that complements any size laundry room. Its powder coated, welded steel construction features three shelf tiers that adjust in 1.5-inch increments with wire decking that won’t collect dust and are easy to maintain. The bottom shelf can be removed and mounted to the side of the rack, allowing you to add hooks for more storage options. This rack is large enough to fit around most front and top-loading washer and dryer sets thanks to an inside width of 55-inches. The boltless design of how the crossbeams and uprights connect means that once assembled, adjusting the shelves does not require the use of any tools. To protect your flooring the feet have nylon pads and the shelves each have a load strap across the bottom to prevent them from warping under load and for added safety a wall anchor is included that can prevent accidental tipping of the rack. Interlocking beams and stacking brackets also make it easy to increase both the length and height, making this rack a welcome addition to any laundry or storage room. J. Hanlon offers two collections of storage racks that effortlessly combine form, function, and versatility. The Vintage Loft Series was inspired by old factory shelving, fusing industrial metal with rustic charm. Each rack adds a touch of vintage appeal to your home, complementing a variety of décor styles. The Seabrook Home Series features clean, modern silhouettes designed to organize your everyday life. From extra storage in the laundry room to creating the closet of your dreams, this collection is as practical as it is pretty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QOEfj3otL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J. HANLON","source_asin":"B01M2CTJ7R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M2CTJ7R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M2CTJ7R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
