window.products.push({"id":937640,"name":"NICESOUL L-59'' Home Office Computer Desk with Hutch and Shelf Computer Table Metal Frame Dark Walnut Wooden Desktop New Modern Design (59''L- Black W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715oqF6zwqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Ø Spacious Desktop & Ample Storage Shelves:The computer desk comes with an ample desk surface and an additional opening shelves. The large full-size workstation provide ample storage to lay your books, papers, documents, laptop on the spacious tabletop. And you can put some books, plants or printer on the 5-tier shelves. It can totally maximize the daily working and reading enjoyment. Ø Durable and Sturdy Construction:The desk is constructed by high quality MDF board and iron tube, the iron tube frame offers large weight capacity, the desk can hold about 200lbs. Powder coated surface with outstanding corrosion resistant performance shows long-term glossy appearance. Plus, solid connection and exquisite craftsmanship will serve you better. Ø Multifunctional:The Computer Desk features a Hutch and Open Shelf to hold your books and other essentials, which leaves plenty of surface space for your laptop etc.which could make your things well organized, keep your desktop clean and tidy. Open cubes on the top of the desk provide a perfect space for your books and decorations, Easy to storage or reach your books for files within your arm’s reach Ø Smooth Surface & Sturdy Metal Frame:The table design with smooth edge and flat surface for writing. Our Study table with steel tubing frame and soft liftable feet protector to prevent floor from being scratched and the liftable design makes it stable even in un-flat surface Ø Industrial Design for Versatile Usage: Industrial as well as stylish appearance endows the desk with infinite charm. The home office desk with shelf will be a worthwhile addition in living room, bedroom, study and office, fitting well with any décor and creating a harmonious living working environment for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715oqF6zwqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NICESOUL","source_asin":"B08CKDSW35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CKDSW35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CKDSW35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
