window.products.push({"id":937791,"name":"Nemesis Now Pickle Rick Toilet Roll Holder 22.5cm, Resin, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TqylRgx+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It s Pickle Rick. Officially licensed and created by alternative brand Nemesis Now, this fantastic Toilet Roll Holder is shaped like a long green pickled gherkin, with the menacing face of Pickle Rick staring directly at you, backed by an interdimensional portal. Not just a Pickle anymore, this holder portrays Rick s fully evolved form that features a makeshift exoskeleton made from the limbs of a cockroach and the corpses of a group of rats. Rick used these to create the perfect mechanisms for him to move around (and even create a jet pack). Cast in the finest resin before being expertly hand-painted, and a perfect reminder not to let your pickle friends get swept away into the sewers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TqylRgx+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nemesis Now","source_asin":"B08D4G92TT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-937791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D4G92TT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D4G92TT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
